      "writtenOn": "2021-02-02T16:02:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes! Thank you. Unfortunately a zero sized signature is accepted by fs-verity if fsverity_require_signature is not set, which it wasn\u0027t in my test. So a bad signature would fail, but an empty one would not.\n\nAdded test where we try to use a bad signature, made sure it fails, and then fixed this error.",
